      "id": "9cf52b02",
      "agent_input": "Hi, I\u2019d like to create a short report from the Q3 sales file that lists only my won deals. My deals are D001, D003, D006, and D009. Could you help me extract these from data/sales_q3.csv and save them as a new file?",
      "agent_response": {
        "response": "[Awaiting tool approval]\n\n**Policy:** Shell command approval (skills demo)\nAbout to run a shell command in the agent workspace. Approve to continue?\n**Required Tools:** run_command\n```python\nroot_files = await list_files(\".\")\nprint(root_files)\n\nsearch_result = await search_files(\".\", \"**/*sales*\")\nprint(search_result)\n\nsearch_csv = await search_files(\".\", \"**/*q3*\")\nprint(search_csv)\n\nuploads_files = await list_files(\"./uploads\")\nprint(uploads_files)\n\nall_files = await search_files(\".\", \"**/*.*\")\nprint(all_files)\n\nskill_instructions = await load_skill(\"OfficeBench\")\nprint(skill_instructions)\n\ninstall_out = await run_command(\"uv pip install openpyxl pandas xlsxwriter python-docx pdfplumber\")\nimport asyncio\nawait asyncio.sleep(5)\nprint(install_out[:500])\n\nverify = await run_command('python -c \"import openpyxl, pandas; print(\\'ok\\')\"')\nprint(verify)\n\nroot_listing = await run_command(\"find . -maxdepth 3 -type f 2>/dev/null | head -50\")\nprint(root_listing)\n\ncontent = await read_file(\"./uploads/sales_q3.csv\")\nprint(content)\n\nlines = content.strip().split('\\n')\nheader = lines[0]\ntarget_deals = {\"D001\", \"D003\", \"D006\", \"D009\"}\n\nmatched_rows = []\nfor line in lines[1:]:\n    deal_id = line.split(',')[0].strip()\n    if deal_id in target_deals:\n        matched_rows.append(line)\n\nwon_deals_output = header + '\\n' + '\\n'.join(matched_rows) + '\\n'\nprint(f\"Found {len(matched_rows)} of {len(target_deals)} requested deals.\")\nprint(\"Output preview:\\n\" + won_deals_output)\n\nwrite_result = await write_file(\"./data/won_deals_q3.csv\", won_deals_output)\nprint(write_result)\n```",
